# A phone call: one comes in (a test call, as a quest would trigger it)
# and V answers it. Needs a session (story commands are a session's).
limit 90
needs session == 1
sim session
sim call
if call == 0
  cmd story call judy
end
until call == 1 timeout 15
act call answer
until call != 1 timeout 10
wait 3
cmd story call end judy
